[{"answer":"Hello?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I wanted to enquire about hiring a room in the Village Hall,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/3.mp3"},{"answer":"for the evening of September the first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me just see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we have both rooms available that evening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/6.mp3"},{"answer":"There's our Main Hall - that's got seating for 200 people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Or there's the Charlton Room...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/9.mp3"},{"answer":"The Charlton Room - C-H-A-R-L-T-O-N.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/10.mp3"},{"answer":"That's got seating for up to one hundred.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we're organising a dinner to raise money for a charity,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and we're hoping for at least 150 people,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/13.mp3"},{"answer":"so I think we'll go for the Main Hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/14.mp3"},{"answer":"How much would that cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/16.mp3"},{"answer":"You wanted it for the evening of September the 1st?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's a Saturday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So from six pm to midnight","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/19.mp3"},{"answer":"that'd be £115.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/20.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the weekend price, it's £75 on weekdays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/21.mp3"},{"answer":"That's all right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/22.mp3"},{"answer":"And I have to tell you there's also a deposit of £250,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/23.mp3"},{"answer":"which is returnable of course as long as there's no damage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/24.mp3"},{"answer":"But we do insist that this is paid in cash,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/25.mp3"},{"answer":"we don't take cards for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/26.mp3"},{"answer":"You can pay the actual rent of the room however you like though - cash, credit card, cheque...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, well I suppose that's OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/28.mp3"},{"answer":"So does the charge include use of tables and chairs and so on?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/30.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about parking?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's all included.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/32.mp3"},{"answer":"The only thing that isn't included is...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/33.mp3"},{"answer":"you said you were organising a dinner?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you'll have to pay extra for the kitchen if you want to use that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/36.mp3"},{"answer":"It's £25.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It's got very good facilities -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/38.mp3"},{"answer":"good quality cookers and fridges and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/39.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well I suppose that's all right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/40.mp3"},{"answer":"We can cover the cost in our entry charges.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/42.mp3"},{"answer":"So I'll make a note of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Now there are just one or two things you need to think about before the event.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/44.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, you'll have to see about getting a licence if you're planning to have any music during the meal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/46.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite straightforward, I'll give you the details later on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/47.mp3"},{"answer":"And about a week or ten days before your event you'll need to contact the caretaker, that's Mr Evans,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/48-2023-09-06-16-37-44.mp3"},{"answer":"to make the arrangements for entry -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/49.mp3"},{"answer":"he'll sort that out with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/50.mp3"},{"answer":"And do I give him the payment as well?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/51.mp3"},{"answer":"No, you do that directly with me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. Now is there anything I need to know about what happens during the event?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, as you'll be aware, of course the building is no smoking throughout.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, are you having a band?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they'll have a lot of equipment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/58.mp3"},{"answer":"so rather than using the front door they should park their van round the back","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and use the stage door there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/60.mp3"},{"answer":"You can open that from inside but don't forget to lock it at the end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/61.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/62.mp3"},{"answer":"And talking of bands, I'm sure I don't need to tell you this,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/63.mp3"},{"answer":"but you must make sure that no one fiddles about with the black box by the fire door -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/64.mp3"},{"answer":"that's a system that cuts in when the volume reaches a certain level.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/65.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a legal requirement.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, we want people to be able to talk to one another","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/68.mp3"},{"answer":"so we don't want anything too loud.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that reminds me, we'll be having speeches.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Are there any microphones available?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. Just let the caretaker know, he'll get those for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, now when the event is over we do ask that the premises are left in good condition.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/73.mp3"},{"answer":"So there's a locked cupboard","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/74.mp3"},{"answer":"and you'll be informed of the code you need to open that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/75.mp3"},{"answer":"It's got all the cleaning equipment, brushes and detergent and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/77.mp3"},{"answer":"So what do we need to do after everyone's gone?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Sweep the floors I suppose?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, actually they have to be washed, not just swept.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you'll be provided with black plastic bags,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/81.mp3"},{"answer":"so all the rubbish must be collected up and left outside the door.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/83.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll make sure everything's left tidy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and I forgot to ask,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/85.mp3"},{"answer":"I presume we can have decorations in the room?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but you must take them down afterwards.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/88.mp3"},{"answer":"And the chairs and tables should be stacked up neatly at the back of the room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/89.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll make sure I've got a few people to help me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-1-part-1-2023-06-03-12-38-13/90.mp3"}]
